{"parentUuid":"7ab2f33d-9967-454c-8de9-23d0a4755966","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01XdX6R33XCU9bYmZkpjuDXN","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"81f0d9c7-30eb-490e-80cf-3009e0490bb4","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:47:00.940Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"81f0d9c7-30eb-490e-80cf-3009e0490bb4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgygwUGCFFTaWcFRh7jTu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"S4 is committed as 6a74e98 and not pushed. With it, S1 to S4 of the plan are done.\n\n**How a charter edit works:**\n- On the Workspaces page, each charter has an Edit row: AGENTS.md, `.agents/settings.json`, each agent's `.md`, and each skill's `SKILL.md`. Clicking one opens an editor with \"Save on a new branch\" and \"Cancel\".\n- The server checks the path first. Core `charter::editable` allows only those files, and refuses `..`, absolute paths and any other path.\n- It makes the branch `<prefix>charter-<time>` in a temporary `git worktree`, commits there, and removes the worktree. The workspace's checkout and its base branch don't change.\n- If the commit fails, the server deletes the branch again.\n- The app then says \"Committed on the branch …. Merge it for jobs to use it.\" The factory reads the charter from the base commit, so the edit applies after you merge it.\n\n**Live test, on my scratch repo `demo-local`:** The save made `ian/charter-1794516316` with the commit \"Edit AGENTS.md from Bastion\". `main` and the checkout did not change, and no worktree was left. Then I deleted that branch and reset the repo to its original commit and its original AGENTS.md. I didn't touch your `bastion-gh` repo.\n\n**Checks:** fmt, seams, clippy and every test pass. A count test needed 79 → 80 for the new request. The safeguard passed. New tests cover the allowed paths, the git steps of an edit, and \"a failed commit leaves no branch behind\".\n\n**Known gaps:**\n- A workspace with no charter can't create AGENTS.md from the app, because only files that already exist are listed.\n- In the test, typing into the editor replaced the file's text instead of adding to it. That may be how the test tool typed, so I'm not sure it's a bug.\n- Server \"two\" still runs an old build.\n- The factory lines are still global settings.\n\nOnly 1.6Gi of disk is free."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":269,"cache_read_input_tokens":438694,"output_tokens":667,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":269,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":438694,"cache_creation_input_tokens":269,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":269},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8de131be-252a-4b7c-9e0c-d02dc6fb4c74","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgygwTscxSae5E1Unp5bF","type":"assistant","uuid":"ebe719c5-e1ae-4495-a16d-58056acbdf2b","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:47:00.938Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
