{"parentUuid":"d9556c2c-c9f3-452d-8648-d2f6508b8977","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4d2f9563-2eb9-4fc2-ac2d-83a7c53a99bd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"ok, let's do a review and analysis of this application\nIs it understandable? Is it useful? It is easy to use?\nMost of it works the way I want, but the interface could be better.\nI want it to align with the vision.\nI want the user to be able to use one or more bastion servers to submit requests to run jobs through worfklows\nThe user should also be able to manage all the peices of each server in an effective and human comprehensible way - perhaps a visual map\nThe user should be able to easily change something if they need something very specific, but most of their time will be on the jobs page\nPlan out a rebrand of the layout of the UI/UX to make this program easy to understand and use\nEach of these things is an important concept and should be easy to manage\nOnce set up, most interaction will be on the job\nAlso look for opportunities to unify or separate concepts and ways to incorporate them in novel ways and also look out for hidden entities we haven't defined yet"},"uuid":"ab26c16f-7bfd-40f2-8e3d-9fb9a5c80e5c","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:54:57.573Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":198,"turnIndex":299},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
