{"parentUuid":"34f59b2f-4265-4a1e-9652-49ceecffcf45","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4d2f9563-2eb9-4fc2-ac2d-83a7c53a99bd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DdSyaKXfEsvFeXxV8SbeNH","type":"tool_result","content":"## Open questions\n\n- **Plugins.** iii has no plugin. Is a plugin a bundle of the above (an\n  agent, its skills, its hooks and its MCP servers) that a step takes as\n  one?\n- **Stdio MCP servers.** Should one run in the job's VM, so a step may use\n  a local MCP server without breaking the VM rule?\n- **Codified and ambient context.** Constraints and direction are codified\n  context: written down, stable, and Bastion can scope and judge them.\n  Ambient context comes from MCP servers and other outside sources: it is\n  scattered, it changes over time, and it depends on state. How should\n  Bastion handle it: where it came from, how fresh it is, and when to read\n  it again? Today an MCP server is only a grant.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9f4f835b-5259-453c-a396-185ca9232d0e","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:56:08.216Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Open questions\n\n- **Plugins.** iii has no plugin. Is a plugin a bundle of the above (an\n  agent, its skills, its hooks and its MCP servers) that a step takes as\n  one?\n- **Stdio MCP servers.** Should one run in the job's VM, so a step may use\n  a local MCP server without breaking the VM rule?\n- **Codified and ambient context.** Constraints and direction are codified\n  context: written down, stable, and Bastion can scope and judge them.\n  Ambient context comes from MCP servers and other outside sources: it is\n  scattered, it changes over time, and it depends on state. How should\n  Bastion handle it: where it came from, how fresh it is, and when to read\n  it again? Today an MCP server is only a grant.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9a0598ec-3b4f-427a-8f9e-ec0f99911247","context":{"git