{"parentUuid":"2385ce54-3178-4f5c-8989-87b7ae57fad2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyiGFnzwqcZRh23VK77Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UyYnnDSTeo2ry51FRtg5rs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:60]; s=s.replace(a,b,1)\nrep(\"`Jobs · Map · Workflows · Workspaces · Harness · Insights · Server`\",\"`Jobs · Map · Workflows · Workspaces · Harness · Insights · Settings`\")\nrep('''- **Server** holds the server itself: people, models and providers,\n  notifications, settings history, and the engine's health.\n- A sun or moon at the right of the bar switches light and dark.''','''- **Settings** holds this app's settings (its theme and its servers) and\n  the server's: people, models and providers, notifications, settings\n  history, and the engine's health.''')\nrep('''- Light and dark: about 230 color uses in 32 files read constants today.\n  They become a palette picked at run time, with a toggle in the bar that\n  the app remembers. D4 changes.''','''- Themes: about 230 color uses in 32 files read constants today. They\n  become a named palette picked at run time, chosen in Settings and kept by\n  the app. The first two are `bastion-dark` and `bastion-light`; more can\n  be added later. D4 changes.''')\nrep(\"- **One theme.** D4 allows only dark.\",\"- **One theme.** D4 allows only dark, and there is no way to add another.\")\nrep('''  tabs. Server takes Settings and Engine.''','''  tabs. Settings takes Engine as the server's health.''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"Server\\b\" PLAN.md | head","description":"Plan: themes in Settings"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":978,"cache_read_input_tokens":496473,"output_tokens":711,"output_tokens_deta