or moon at the right of the bar switches light and dark.","+- **Settings** holds this app's settings (its theme and its servers) and","+  the server's: people, models and providers, notifications, settings","+  history, and the engine's health."," "," ### Jobs: where the day goes"," "]},{"oldStart":204,"oldLines":15,"newStart":204,"newLines":16,"lines":[" "," - A glossary in DECISIONS.md, and every page's text moved to the words in","   the table above.","-- Light and dark: about 230 color uses in 32 files read constants today.","-  They become a palette picked at run time, with a toggle in the bar that","-  the app remembers. D4 changes.","+- Themes: about 230 color uses in 32 files read constants today. They","+  become a named palette picked at run time, chosen in Settings and kept by","+  the app. The first two are `bastion-dark` and `bastion-light`; more can","+  be added later. D4 changes."," - Shorter ledes on every page."," "," ### L2. The bar"," "," - Seven entries. Insights takes Audit Log, Costs, Evals and Verification as","-  tabs. Server takes Settings and Engine.","+  tabs. Settings takes Engine as the server's health."," - The Harness page replaces the three rules tabs, with the kind filter."," "," ### L3. Jobs as home"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/PLAN.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ebe4d927-9015-41d7-8369-7a6c46c611d3","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4d1d7c06-8dbc-4cba-82fe-8543b9daa2f6","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Use