{"parentUuid":"82d07abc-64c0-419a-bf91-5f5d29925f40","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d6c48980-e6d1-4a53-8117-62a21260a36e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011Z2mKPTZkrzt2dkpY1MC8J","type":"tool_result","content":"bd7fa2f Plan: a layout people can read","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2e43aac0-e54a-413f-a00b-983d31be8786","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:04:35.315Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"bd7fa2f Plan: a layout people can read","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/PLAN.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":179,"oldLines":7,"newStart":179,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - Each item shows where it applies as chips: one step, a workflow, some","   workflows, all workflows. Clicking the chips opens the picker."," - Promote and demote stay on the item: Guidance or Check, Ask or Allowed.","-- MCP servers move here from Server, as tools.","+- MCP servers move here from Settings, as tools."," - Plugins sit here too: Install, then each part listed under its plugin,","   off until applied. Update and Remove are on the plugin."," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/PLAN.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7822ab2e-7c1b-49ee-83ec-ed2d156b358a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"82d07abc-64c0-419a-bf91-5f5d29925f40","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"2e43aac0-e54a-413f-a00b-983d31be8786","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_011Z2mKPTZkrzt2dkpY1MC8J","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6cceebe0-d7ab-4cd9-b181-20f0842761f6","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:04:44.472Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"6cceebe0-d7ab-4cd9-b181-20f0842761f6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyiHiBXAsEVvu7yJF6ye","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The mockup is ready to click through: https://claude.ai/artifact/6eTEtwDMyrZnh8b5Sk3k6F\n\n**What it shows:**\n- **The bar:** `Jobs · Map · Workflows · Workspaces · Harness · Insights · Settings`. The server switcher works as it does now.\n- **Jobs:** an inline new request, then **Decisions** (an approval, a held call, a charter branch to merge, a failed job), then In progress and Finished. \"Open\" on a decision opens the job.\n- **A job:** the steps as progress, one line saying what it waits for, and tabs. The Steps tab shows attempts and a refused call with \"Allow this at this step\". The Rules tab shows what applied at the step and links to Harness.\n- **Map:** click any harness item and the steps it applies at light up. A side panel shows where it applies and how to change it. On All servers each server gets its own section.\n- **Harness:** one list with Kind and From filters (Bastion, a charter, a plugin), each item's \"applies at\" chip, and promote/demote. A Plugins card shows caveman installed at a pinned commit, with its parts off until applied.\n- **Workspaces:** one card each with checks, landing and charter, plus Proposals (a charter branch to merge).\n- **Settings:** \"This app\" with the theme picker (`bastion-dark`, `bastion-light`) and the servers list, then \"This server\" (people, models, health, notifications, history).\n\n**Plan:** I committed it as bd7fa2f, not pushed.\n- **Themes:** named themes chosen in Settings, with no toggle in the bar. The first two are `bastion-dark` and `bastion-light`, and D4 changes.\n- **Plugins:** a table maps Claude Code's primitives to Bastion's. Slash commands are left out; a shell or prompt step covers them. A plugin is a git repository with a manifest of skills, agents, hooks and MCP servers. You install it on a server at a pinned commit, and each part shows on Harness, off, until you apply it. Caveman is the first plugin to try.\n- **Phases:** L0 mockup (this one), L1 words and themes, L2 bar, L3 Jobs home, L4 job page, L5 Map, L6 landing per workspace, L7 plugins, L8 first run.\n\n**Not shown yet:** the Steps canvas inside Workflows is a simplified row of steps. Insights shows only its first tab.\n\nTell me what to change in the mockup, or say go and I'll start L1."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":262,"cache_read_input_tokens":498218,"output_tokens":835,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":262,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":835,"cache_read_input_tokens":498218,"cache_creation_input_tokens":262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":262},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c6314c2d-c576-4865-8dfd-b1ca00ba05a5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgyiHhqBhM7uAQSx3kVRr","type":"assistant","uuid":"91218c68-19e0-4226-b5df-e22445bf3881","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:04:44.469Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
