{"parentUuid":"fa53b2fc-0953-4292-adbc-817beb40fead","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c05ae742-b7ea-4081-ac5f-2b7df3580a90","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018phWf6qMrQyKhnayEeYQD9","type":"tool_result","content":"Expedition map\nTHE SOFTWARE EXPEDITION\nA field guide to the map\nEvery landmark is something your team already does. You don't have to say any of these words at standup.\nON THE MAP\nWHAT HAPPENS THERE\nIN SOFTWARE\nSETTING OUT\nThe outpost\nWord arrives: go explore\nA request, a bug, a page, a cron job\nThe summit\nYou pick it before you leave\nThe outcome you want: it works\nThe guide\nGets you up the mountain\nThe agent harness: models, tools, the loop\nBase camp\nSomewhere safe to set up\nA branch, a sandbox, a worktree\nON THE TRAIL\nThe charter\nHow we work, and how we check\nStandards, plus the gates that check them\nThe checkpoint\nA known good state to come back to\nA green build, a commit you trust\nThe range of reality\nThe ground pushes back\nFailing tests, red CI, the 2 a.m. page\nThe final peak\nIt actually works\nUAT passes\nTHE RECORD\nThe track\nEvery step, written down on the way\nTraces, logs, the audit log\nCOMING BACK\nSpecimens\nWhat you carry home\nThe change you shipped\nField notes\nWhat you learned, signed by a person\nWhat reality told you\nThe marsh\nA trail that went nowhere\nWork that moved nothing, said out loud\nTHE MAP\nThe atlas\nEverything the team has learned\nWhere the next piece of work starts\nTerra incognita\nOnly visible from the summit\nThe next valuable piece of work\nKept by the team. The sea serpent is decorative. Mostly.\nblog.tacoda.dev\n 197 #3b2a1a\n  25 #9b2c1f\n  24 #8a7350\n  21 #7a2418\n  17 #b9a67a\n  16 #efe4c8\n  15 #e5d6b0\n  15 #cdbb8a\n   7 #6b5233\n   6 #dccca2\n   6 #d8c79c\n   5 #f1e6c9\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4ed30efe-1a42-41c7-bc19-fe5cf5eeec7b","timestamp":"2026-11-12T21:11:41.881Z","toolUseResu